Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}because Allah will ask you\Nabout what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:03.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}you say as Allah mentioned in\NSurah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:04.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Al-Turk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:07.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Don't say what you don't know\Nabout.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:08.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}If you don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.79,0:00:09.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}say, I don't know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Similarly, when a learned\Nperson is asked
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.63,0:00:14.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}a question of knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.98,0:00:15.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}if he does not know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:16.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}he should say, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.26,0:00:19.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}La adil, la adil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:21.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}But when you don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:22.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}you say Allahu Ya'lamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Many of the scholars say,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:25.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}no, don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:26.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}If you don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.55,0:00:27.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}say la adil, la adil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:30.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}But if you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.53,0:00:33.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}after full explanations and\Nall of these,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:35.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}you cap it all up by saying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.46,0:00:37.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Allahu Ya'lamu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:39.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}by way of humbling yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:41.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}by way of affirming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.16,0:00:43.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}that absolute knowledge of\Nevery matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:47.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}comprehensive knowledge of\Nevery matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:50.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}having and encompassing\Nunderstanding of every matter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:52.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}belongs to Allah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:54.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}then that is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}So, you can see that our Deen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.77,0:01:00.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Islam places a lot of\Nemphasis on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:02.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}things we say.

